5764704","game_id":"steam-4334090","kind":"announcement","title":"More Updates & Act 1 OST Announcement","summary":"Hello folks, Turrer here. I have a small update.In the previous post, I mentioned that it would be the last update before release. However, since the launch window has been extended, that will no longer be the case.There’s now more time before release, so I’ll continue sharing updates as development progresses.Additionally, I’m happy to announce that the full Act 1 OST will be released sometime this week.It will be available on platforms like Spotify, SoundCloud, and YouTube, so you’ll be able t","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-03-24T00:44:29Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1827626365764704","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:43:34Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4334090-1827626365761134","game_id":"steam-4334090","kind":"announcement","title":"Early Access Release Slightly Delayed","summary":"Hello folks, Turrer here. I have an update regarding the Early Access release.To make Act 1 as complete as possible, including all levels, bosses, and the full soundtrack, we’ve decided to include Phase 2 before launch. This means the release will be slightly delayed compared to our previous estimate.We’re now aiming for a release sometime between June and August 2026, giving us the time to ensure polish, balance, and a full Act 1 experience for everyone.We appreciate your patience and support—i","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-03-22T03:03:44Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1827626365761134","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:43:34Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4334090":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T12:07:47Z","status":"ok","all_sources